# TypeScript — web

Strict mode, ESNext, bundler resolution. Config: `web/.config/tsconfig.json`.

## Path aliases

| Alias | Resolves to |
|-------|-------------|
| `nucleify` | `web/src/nucleify.ts` |
| `modules` / `modules/*` | `shared_modules` / `shared_modules/*` |
| `nuc_api` | `shared_modules/nuc_api/supabase/api/server.ts` |
| `nuc_server` | `web/src/server/nuc_server.ts` |
| `~/*` | `web/src/*` |

